workedExamples.question_text:
A class has $36$ students. Three quarters bring lunch.
(a) How many students bring lunch?
(b) How many do not bring lunch?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=1cm]
\path[use as bounding box] (-0.2,-0.6) rectangle (6.2,1.8);
\draw[black] (0,0) rectangle (6,0.9);
\foreach \x in {1.5,3,4.5} {\draw[black] (\x,0)--(\x,0.9);}
\foreach \x in {0.75,2.25,3.75,5.25} {\node at (\x,0.45) {$9$};}
\node[above] at (3,1.1) {$36$ students in all};
\node[below] at (3,-0.1) {four equal groups};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
